note Cholesky self-check. Integer factor and one rounded factor from Wolfram
fn chk g ulong w ulong to int
if ne g w
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
fn load3 to void
put pa 0 1082130432
put pa 1 1094713344
put pa 2 3246391296
put pa 3 1094713344
put pa 4 1108606976
put pa 5 3257663488
put pa 6 3246391296
put pa 7 3257663488
